{
    "title": "Checkout 51: Cash Back Savings",
    "description": "Earn rewards and cash back with Checkout 51\u2013 the ultimate savings app for shopping. Save tons of money on your favorite brands, groceries, and necessities through coupons and deals you can redeem in just a few taps. With Checkout 51\u2019s receipt scanner you can save on everyday items with a quick snapshot.\r\n\r\nGas cash back? New fuel rewards offer smart drivers cash back on fuel too! Members can earn up to 25\u00a2/gallon on purchases. Earn Cash Back at gas stations like Shell, Chevron, BP, Exxon, Mobile, etc. Earn rewards on gas every time you fuel up!\r\n\r\nEarn cash back to combat the rising cost of living on everyday items like groceries, clothing, transportation, and more! Checkout 51 is your resource for saving money when it matters most. Earn rewards on your day-to-day purchases to shop worry-free for countless items at your favorite stores.\r\n\r\nCash back rewards are right at your fingertips. Find grocery offers, fuel rewards, and shopping discounts with a cash back and coupons app that saves you money. New deals are available every week on everyday items and can be found at all your favorite stores.\r\n\r\nSave money with these simple steps:\r\n\r\n1. Shop for groceries, clothes, home goods, and more!\r\n2. Add the offer to your C51 list\r\n3. Upload a photo of your purchase with our receipt scanner\r\n4. Earn cash rewards!\r\n\r\nEarning rewards for your purchases is that simple. Get the savings app that gives cash back on everyday items today with Checkout 51!\r\n\r\nWhere you can save money:\r\n\r\nGrocery \u2014 Cash back offers are added every week! Enjoy savings on essentials like bread, eggs, snacks and more! Shop from top brands like Nivea, Welch\u2019s, Bounce, Triscuit, and more to earn rewards on all your groceries.\r\n\r\nGas \u2014 Earn rewards at participating stations, check the map to find one near you!\r\n\r\nPrescription \u2014 Find discount prescriptions with our Checkout 51 Prescriptions Card, powered by CleverRx.\r\n\r\nSurveys \u2014 Now you can complete surveys for cash for a quick and easy way to make money!\r\n\r\nOnline offers \u2014 Save on participating retailers online when you shop through the Checkout 51 app.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s simple, we help you make money in your day-to-day life, however you choose to spend it. Ready to start earning?\r\n\r\nEarn Cash Back Instantly from Your Receipt:\r\n- Earn cash back with our receipt scanner to redeem offers seamlessly\r\n- Cash out once you reach $20 in our savings app\r\n- View savings balance any time\r\n\r\nEarn Rewards on Gas\r\n- Earn cash back rewards when you fill up your tank\r\n- Fuel rewards at the gas stations you frequent\r\n- Gas rebates to help you save at the pump\r\n- Gas prices comparison to help you find the best cash back deal on gasoline\r\n- You have 4 hours from the time you add the offer to fill up your tank, so only add offers when you\u2019re ready to get gas. Note: all gas offers must be purchased with a debit or credit card.\r\n- Upload your receipt to the Checkout 51 rewards app within 24 hours\r\n\r\nCash Back at your Favorite Stores:\r\n- Earn rewards and save money at your favorite stores\r\n- Cash back savings from Walmart, Target, CVS, Kroger, Safeway, Walgreens, HEB,\r\nPublix, Costco, Whole Foods, Sam\u2019s Club, Babies R Us & more!\r\n- Savings app discounts apply wherever you shop for convenient saving!\r\n- Save the offers that interest you to quickly find them later\r\n\r\nStop coupon hunting and earn cash back on everything from grocery and household items, to gas. Save money and time with Checkout 51 to put more savings in your wallet!\r\n\r\nPlease note, Checkout 51 uses your location services if enabled in settings to find the best deals near you.\r\n\r\nFor support, please contact us at: https://www.checkout51.com/contact\r\n\r\nCalifornia Residents: Please follow this link to exercise your right to opt out of the sale of your personal information under the California Consumer Privacy Act - \"Do Not Sell My Personal Information\" [www.checkout51.com/CCPA-do-not-sell.]",
    "descriptionHTML": "Earn rewards and cash back with Checkout 51\u2013 the ultimate savings app for shopping. Save tons of money on your favorite brands, groceries, and necessities through coupons and deals you can redeem in just a few taps. With Checkout 51\u2019s receipt scanner you can save on everyday items with a quick snapshot.<br><br>Gas cash back? New fuel rewards offer smart drivers cash back on fuel too! Members can earn up to 25\u00a2/gallon on purchases. Earn Cash Back at gas stations like Shell, Chevron, BP, Exxon, Mobile, etc. Earn rewards on gas every time you fuel up!<br><br>Earn cash back to combat the rising cost of living on everyday items like groceries, clothing, transportation, and more! Checkout 51 is your resource for saving money when it matters most. Earn rewards on your day-to-day purchases to shop worry-free for countless items at your favorite stores.<br><br>Cash back rewards are right at your fingertips. Find grocery offers, fuel rewards, and shopping discounts with a cash back and coupons app that saves you money. New deals are available every week on everyday items and can be found at all your favorite stores.<br><br>Save money with these simple steps:<br><br>1. Shop for groceries, clothes, home goods, and more!<br>2. Add the offer to your C51 list<br>3. Upload a photo of your purchase with our receipt scanner<br>4. Earn cash rewards!<br><br>Earning rewards for your purchases is that simple. Get the savings app that gives cash back on everyday items today with Checkout 51!<br><br>Where you can save money:<br><br>Grocery \u2014 Cash back offers are added every week! Enjoy savings on essentials like bread, eggs, snacks and more! Shop from top brands like Nivea, Welch\u2019s, Bounce, Triscuit, and more to earn rewards on all your groceries.<br><br>Gas \u2014 Earn rewards at participating stations, check the map to find one near you!<br><br>Prescription \u2014 Find discount prescriptions with our Checkout 51 Prescriptions Card, powered by CleverRx.<br><br>Surveys \u2014 Now you can complete surveys for cash for a quick and easy way to make money!<br><br>Online offers \u2014 Save on participating retailers online when you shop through the Checkout 51 app.<br><br>It\u2019s simple, we help you make money in your day-to-day life, however you choose to spend it. Ready to start earning?<br><br>Earn Cash Back Instantly from Your Receipt:<br>- Earn cash back with our receipt scanner to redeem offers seamlessly<br>- Cash out once you reach $20 in our savings app<br>- View savings balance any time<br><br>Earn Rewards on Gas<br>- Earn cash back rewards when you fill up your tank<br>- Fuel rewards at the gas stations you frequent<br>- Gas rebates to help you save at the pump<br>- Gas prices comparison to help you find the best cash back deal on gasoline<br>- You have 4 hours from the time you add the offer to fill up your tank, so only add offers when you\u2019re ready to get gas. Note: all gas offers must be purchased with a debit or credit card.<br>- Upload your receipt to the Checkout 51 rewards app within 24 hours<br><br>Cash Back at your Favorite Stores:<br>- Earn rewards and save money at your favorite stores<br>- Cash back savings from Walmart, Target, CVS, Kroger, Safeway, Walgreens, HEB,<br>Publix, Costco, Whole Foods, Sam\u2019s Club, Babies R Us &amp; more!<br>- Savings app discounts apply wherever you shop for convenient saving!<br>- Save the offers that interest you to quickly find them later<br><br>Stop coupon hunting and earn cash back on everything from grocery and household items, to gas. Save money and time with Checkout 51 to put more savings in your wallet!<br><br>Please note, Checkout 51 uses your location services if enabled in settings to find the best deals near you.<br><br>For support, please contact us at: https://www.checkout51.com/contact<br><br>California Residents: Please follow this link to exercise your right to opt out of the sale of your personal information under the California Consumer Privacy Act - &quot;Do Not Sell My Personal Information&quot; [www.checkout51.com/CCPA-do-not-sell.]",
